#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:17
#: 2a8b6aef74d7427ea859e08296e9f015
msgid ""
"Send a mode change on the command topic, and read the active mode on the "
"status topic. `teleop/controller_state` carries the event code. A `0` "
"means this frame had no button edge. UPDATE, STORAGE, pause, and mirror "
"are fields of `TeleopModeState` on `teleop/mode_state`."
msgstr ""
"改模式发在命令话题上，当前模式到状态话题上读。`teleop/controller_state` 带的是事件码。`0` "
"表示这一帧没有按键边沿。UPDATE、STORAGE、暂停和镜像是 `teleop/mode_state` 上 `TeleopModeState` "
"的字段。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:19
#: 234bb24b92314bd78be701fe2bc42239
msgid ""
"A dexterous hand, DualHand, or a UI reads `teleop/mode_state` in an "
"event-bus session, and `teleop_mode` when it follows the joystick or the "
"keyboard. The foot pedal writes its event codes to "
"`teleop/controller_state`."
msgstr ""
"灵巧手、DualHand 或界面在事件总线会话里读 `teleop/mode_state`，跟随手柄或键盘时读 "
"`teleop_mode`。脚踏板把事件码写到 `teleop/controller_state`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:21
#: 1f5a97d041284e0dbac77677cf002b25
msgid "2. Namespace and QoS"
msgstr "​2. 命名空间与 QoS"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:23
#: a09402e88452451ca0ddd3bec228dc3e
msgid ""
"The command and status names above are relative to the robot namespace. "
"With no namespace the event-bus status topic is `/teleop/mode_state`. In "
"namespace `/robot_a` it is `/robot_a/teleop/mode_state`. Subscribe in "
"that same namespace. Two robots in one scene stay apart."
msgstr ""
"上面的命令名和状态名相对机器人命名空间。没有命名空间时，事件总线的状态话题是 `/teleop/mode_state`。命名空间 "
"`/robot_a` 下是 `/robot_a/teleop/mode_state`。在同一个命名空间里订阅。同一场景里的两台机器人互不串扰。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:25
#: c3242819adf840e2be0c8b8d6c2f68e8
msgid ""
"QoS is `Reliable` + `TransientLocal`. The status publisher sends one "
"message at startup, then another when a field changes. A node that starts"
" later still receives the last snapshot."
msgstr "QoS 为 `Reliable` + `TransientLocal`。状态发布端启动时发一条，字段变化时再发一条。后启动的节点仍能收到上一次快照。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:27
#: a3d2f53c09974b5686c2ee9a234aadbe
msgid "ros2 topic echo /robot_a/teleop/mode_state"
msgstr "ros2 topic echo /robot_a/teleop/mode_state"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:31
#: 6be42914b20241dc8fbcca177af05d03
msgid ""
"With an empty namespace, echo `/teleop/mode_state`. Match QoS `Reliable` "
"+ `TransientLocal` on the subscription."
msgstr ""
"命名空间为空时，echo `/teleop/mode_state`。订阅端使用同样的 QoS `Reliable` + "
"`TransientLocal`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:33
#: d27b3f6ff0ee48a0bd45bd42115cbde5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Headset pose, stick axes, trigger pull, and the shared end-effector poses"
" are the root names in {ref}`the teleop pose stream <teleop-pose-stream>`"
" (`/teleop/head_pose`, `/teleop/left_ee_pose`, and the rest of that set)."
" `teleop/mode_state` follows the robot namespace."
msgstr ""
"头显位姿、摇杆轴、扳机行程，以及共用的末端位姿，都是 {ref}`遥操位姿流 <teleop-pose-stream>` "
"里的根名称（`/teleop/head_pose`、`/teleop/left_ee_pose`，以及这一组里的其余话题）。`teleop/mode_state`"
" 跟随机器人命名空间。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:35
#: efa17eff4eb04ce295aac726050b5784
msgid "3. Event-bus status (`TeleopModeState`)"
msgstr "​3. 事件总线状态（`TeleopModeState`）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:37
#: 8bb16eb84fcf4786a4eb10799574f3d3
msgid ""
"`TeleopModeState` on `teleop/mode_state` is the latched mode for the "
"event bus. `VRInputHandler` publishes a new snapshot when a field "
"changes. The event code for that change is on `teleop/controller_state`. "
"Joystick and keyboard use `TeleopMode` on `teleop_mode`."
msgstr ""
"`teleop/mode_state` 上的 `TeleopModeState` 是事件总线锁存的当前模式。字段变化时，`VRInputHandler` "
"再发一条快照。这次变化的事件码在 `teleop/controller_state` 上。手柄和键盘用 `teleop_mode` 上的 "
"`TeleopMode`。"

