"也在这条消息上，给手和界面读。锁存的夹爪模式是 `left_gripper_percent_mode` / "
"`right_gripper_percent_mode`。开合或比例命令在 `*/target_command` 和 "
"`*/target_percent` 上。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:57
#: aa5326dadbad41629c6e13e4405522f0
msgid "3.1 Arm pause and WBC arm enable"
msgstr "3.1 手臂暂停与 WBC 手臂使能"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:59
#: 68aa2ee9e3024b3c9e9a4d821653a23b
msgid ""
"`left_arm_paused` and `right_arm_paused` are the event-bus teleop pause "
"for that arm. The headset, the foot pedal, and the exoskeleton all write "
"this latch. WBC arm enable is `left_arm_state` and `right_arm_state` on "
"`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state` (`WbcCurrentState`). Teleop pause "
"and WBC enable are separate bits: an arm can be paused here while its WBC"
" state is `ARM_ENABLED`."
msgstr ""
"`left_arm_paused` 和 `right_arm_paused` "
"是这条手臂在事件总线上的遥操暂停。头显、脚踏板和外骨骼都会写这个锁存。WBC 手臂使能是 "
"`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`（`WbcCurrentState`）上的 `left_arm_state` 和 "
"`right_arm_state`。遥操暂停和 WBC 使能是两组位：手臂可以在这里暂停，同时 WBC 状态仍是 `ARM_ENABLED`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:61
#: b6f3ee2342804f2680a0ee7946ecb77c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"On 全身, event 16 switches what left **Y** / right **B** mean. After the "
"switch, `yb_pause_semantics` holds the current meaning. `left_arm_state` "
"and `right_arm_state` are the WBC enable bits. The button chord is on "
"{ref}`Stop one arm vs stop sending VR commands <stop-one-arm-vs-stop-"
"sending-vr-commands>`."
msgstr "在全身下，事件 16 切换左 **Y** / 右 **B** 的含义。切换之后，当前含义记在 `yb_pause_semantics`。`left_arm_state` 和 `right_arm_state` 是 WBC 的使能位。按键组合见 {ref}`停单臂 vs 停发指令 <stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-commands>`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:63
#: f0d6c33677554c9a99e2c7eb65ecfc72
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Field values for `WbcCurrentState`: {ref}`wbc-current-state`. Mode "
"strings on `/mode_command`: {ref}`wbc-mode-command`. `/mode_command` "
"(`std_msgs/String` on the 全身 stack) switches the mode. `current_state` is"
" the status you read."
msgstr ""
"`WbcCurrentState` 各字段的取值见 {ref}`wbc-current-state`。`/mode_command` 上的模式字符串见 "
"{ref}`wbc-mode-command`。`/mode_command`（全身栈上的 "
"`std_msgs/String`）用来切换模式。`current_state` 是读回来的状态。"

