msgid ""
"With Wuji gloves (`wuji_glove_teleop`), arm pose on this pair comes from "
"`tracker_openvr`. The glove node reads `/teleop/controller_state` and "
"`/teleop/mirror_mode`, and publishes finger commands on its own topics. "
"[wuji_glove_teleop](5-wuji_glove.md)."
msgstr ""
"舞肌手套（`wuji_glove_teleop`）跟臂时，这对话题上的手臂位姿来自 `tracker_openvr`。手套节点读取 "
"`/teleop/controller_state` 和 "
"`/teleop/mirror_mode`，手指命令发在它自己的话题上。[wuji_glove_teleop](5-wuji_glove.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:117
#: 7a22afad6bb04cd6a02796c90940ccc9
msgid ""
"`dexcap_cartesian_teleop` reads `/teleop/controller_state` and rebases "
"its virtual pose when the code becomes `4`. Headset pose, sticks, "
"triggers, and `/teleop/xrt_diag` come from `xr_target_node`. In a DexCap-"
"only session, publish a zero `Twist` on `/teleop/thumbstick_axes` so "
"`VRInputHandler` can finish a pending stick-centered check. The command "
"is in the [dexcap_teleop README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/dexcap_teleop_ws/blob/main/src/dexcap_teleop/README.md). Run that "
"zero publisher by itself on `/teleop/thumbstick_axes`."
msgstr ""
"`dexcap_cartesian_teleop` 读取 `/teleop/controller_state`，事件码变为 `4` "
"时重设虚拟位姿的基准。头显位姿、摇杆、扳机和 `/teleop/xrt_diag` 由 `xr_target_node` 发布。只跑 DexCap "
"时，在 `/teleop/thumbstick_axes` 上发一条全零 `Twist`，让 `VRInputHandler` "
"做完待处理的摇杆回中检查。命令写在 [dexcap_teleop "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/dexcap_teleop_ws/blob/main/src/dexcap_teleop/README.md)。这条零值发布单独占着 "
"`/teleop/thumbstick_axes`。"

