msgstr "`/teleop/trigger_values`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:27
#: fb9f27cb96a4421bb09ce8cbcafd0f76
msgid ""
"Left trigger pull in `linear.x`, right trigger pull in `angular.x`. `0.0`"
" is released, `1.0` is full"
msgstr "左扳机行程在 `linear.x`，右扳机行程在 `angular.x`。`0.0` 为松开，`1.0` 为拉满"

