msgid "`xr_target_node`, with the pose frame"
msgstr "`xr_target_node`，与位姿同一帧"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:27
#: 1ef1b5b00cfa493491b594fd04a85b2c
msgid "Pose-frame diagnostic. Control reads the pose topics"
msgstr "位姿帧的诊断。控制读位姿话题"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:131
#: ca7610e2404e47f289ff1b8359dbaf0d
msgid ""
"Poses from `xr_target_node` are in the robot world frame (`x` forward, "
"`y` left, `z` up). WebXR publishes on a fixed 30 Hz timer. XRoboToolkit "
"publishes when the VR `timeStampNs` changes: about 90 Hz with the default"
" Pico App, and about 400 Hz with the enterprise send rate over USB."
msgstr ""
"`xr_target_node` 的位姿在机器人世界系（`x` 向前、`y` 向左、`z` 向上）。WebXR 用固定 30 Hz "
"定时器发布。XRoboToolkit 在 VR 的 `timeStampNs` 变化时发布：默认 Pico App 大约 90 Hz，企业版经 "
"USB 大约 400 Hz。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:133
#: bf1a0ba72de942579a32885b72d4cbca
msgid ""
"Trigger pull depth is on `/teleop/trigger_values` every frame. The press "
"edge is its own code on `/teleop/controller_state` (`9` left, `10` "
"right)."
msgstr ""
"扳机行程每帧都在 `/teleop/trigger_values` 上。按下边沿记在 `/teleop/controller_state`（左 "
"`9`，右 `10`）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:135
#: 4ff73e65c2824eacb79d0a970816f170
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`VRInputHandler` subscribes to the pose topics, "
"`/teleop/controller_state`, `/teleop/thumbstick_axes`, and "
"`/teleop/trigger_values`. Grippers in percent mode follow "
"`trigger_values` when that topic is present. Headset button behavior: "
"{ref}`VR Teleoperation <controller-buttons>`."
msgstr ""
"`VRInputHandler` "
"订阅位姿话题、`/teleop/controller_state`、`/teleop/thumbstick_axes` 和 "
"`/teleop/trigger_values`。百分比模式下的夹爪，在有 `trigger_values` 时跟随它。头显按键见 "
"{ref}`VR 遥操作 <controller-buttons>`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:137
#: cd3752966dd0447ba4656f2ca567d980
msgid ""
"These `/teleop/...` names are root topics. `teleop/mode_state` follows "
"the robot namespace."
msgstr "这些 `/teleop/...` 名称是根话题。`teleop/mode_state` 跟随机器人命名空间。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:139
#: 705cf5b3f1874cffb3fe346fa5b008c7
msgid ""
"The fa-py-libraries `./run.sh vr-record` bag records the headset pose, "
"button, stick, and trigger topics: `/teleop/head_pose`, both end-effector"
" poses, `/teleop/controller_state`, `/teleop/thumbstick_axes`, and "
"`/teleop/trigger_values`."
msgstr ""
"fa-py-libraries 的 `./run.sh vr-record` "
"录包包含头显位姿、按键、摇杆和扳机：`/teleop/head_pose`、左右末端位姿、`/teleop/controller_state`、`/teleop/thumbstick_axes`"
" 和 `/teleop/trigger_values`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/8-topics_and_data.md:141
#: c5803b0ff29f4cfba5e0049c9165135f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Optical wrist presets also publish `/teleop/optical_r0_caps`, "
"`/teleop/optical_r0_request`, `/teleop/optical_r0_ready`, and "
"`/teleop/mirror_mode`. The handshake is in "
"[PROTOCOL_CN.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/vr_pose_publisher/blob/main/docs/PROTOCOL_CN.md). The dexterous-hand "
"joint command on that path is `q_des` ([xr_hand_retarget "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/xr_hand_retarget/blob/main/README.md)). Launch and the headset panel:"
" {ref}`Hand tracking <vr-hand-tracking>`."
msgstr ""
"光学腕预设还会发布 "
"`/teleop/optical_r0_caps`、`/teleop/optical_r0_request`、`/teleop/optical_r0_ready`"
" 和 `/teleop/mirror_mode`。握手在 [PROTOCOL_CN.md](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/vr_pose_publisher/blob/main/docs/PROTOCOL_CN.md)。这条路径上的灵巧手关节命令是 "
"`q_des`（[xr_hand_retarget README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/xr_hand_retarget/blob/main/README.md)）。启动和头显面板见 {ref}`手部追踪 <vr-hand-"
"tracking>`。"

